  "specialCautions": [
    "Sirach/Ecclesiasticus numbering in traditional Douay and the Clementine Vulgate differs from several modern Bible editions, so identify the edition.",
    "Psalm 25, Psalm 96, Psalm 103, Psalm 109 are Catholic Vulgate/Challoner numbering; do not substitute the Hebrew numbering without an explicit crosswalk.",
    "Psalm 103:13-15 includes mountains watered in v13 and bread, wine and oil in vv14-15; avoid saying all symbols are in verse 13.",
